requirements.prompt:
Write docs/requirements.md for this request, following the requirements-spec skill.

<request>
{{input.request}}
</request>

Stack/constraints: {{input.stack}}
Earlier feedback to take into account: {{feedback}}

Report: the requirement IDs with one line each, and your assumptions.

architecture.prompt:
Design the solution for docs/requirements.md. Write docs/architecture.md and ADRs in docs/adr/.
Stack/constraints: {{input.stack}}
Feedback from the design review, if any: {{feedback}}

Report: the stack, the components, and the ADR titles.

approve-design.message:
Requirements and architecture are ready. Approve to start building, or reject with what to change.

Architect's summary:
{{state.architecture}}

fix.prompt:
The quality gates failed. Fix the root causes in the code (change a test only if the test itself is wrong, and say so).

{{feedback}}

Report: what was wrong and what you changed.

address-review.prompt:
Address every BLOCKING and MAJOR finding in docs/reviews/code-review.md and docs/reviews/security-review.md, with tests for each fix. Note how each was resolved at the end of the review file.

Code review: {{state.code-review}}

Security review: {{state.security-review}}

Report: each finding and its resolution.

deliver.prompt:
Write docs/delivery-report.md using the delivery-report skill. Run the quality_gates tool and the tests yourself for the results you report.

Review verdicts: code review - {{state.code-review}}; security review - {{state.security-review}}

Report: the summary section of the delivery report.
